Error [E0313]: `Point { … }` can only destructure a `Point` value, but this is Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/destructure_non_struct.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     Point.{ x } :: 5
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: destructuring with `{ }` pulls fields out of a struct value
 Fix: destructure a `Point`, or bind the whole value with a name
